{
  "id": "c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Wealth and happiness",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what do you think matters most for a happy life?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you feel about money?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, have you ever done something just for the experience rather than the money?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think people in your country are happy with their lives?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e23-a1",
            "c1-e23-a2",
            "c1-e23-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people in different financial situations. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be feeling, and how happy they might be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11500
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these situations would you find most appealing?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e23-b1",
            "c1-e23-b2",
            "c1-e23-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people with different priorities. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might consider important in life, and what they might regret later.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, what would you do if you suddenly became very rich?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that people often say contribute to happiness, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11000
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How much might these things contribute to a person's happiness?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most essential?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about wealth and happiness.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Does money really buy happiness, or is that just a saying?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent do you think comparing ourselves with others affects how happy we feel?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should governments measure the happiness of citizens rather than just economic growth?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it possible to be happy with very little?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think rich people have a responsibility to help others?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, how have the things that make people happy changed over time?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e23-wealth-and-happiness/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
